          </div>

          <!-- How to Measure Advice -->
          <div class="liujo-measure-guide">
            <h4 class="measure-title">HOW TO TAKE YOUR MEASUREMENTS</h4>
            <div class="measure-grid">
              <div class="measure-item">
                <strong>1. BUST:</strong> Measure horizontally around the fullest part of your chest, keeping the tape comfortably snug.
              </div>
              <div class="measure-item">
                <strong>2. WAIST:</strong> Measure around the narrowest natural contour of your waistline above your hip bones.
              </div>
              <div class="measure-item">
                <strong>3. HIPS:</strong> Stand with feet together and measure horizontally around the fullest point of your hips.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
