        <!-- TAB 6: HOW TO TAKE CARE -->
        <div class="liujo-cc-panel{% if section.settings.active_tab == 'care' %} is-active{% endif %}" id="panel-care">
          <div class="liujo-cc-panel__header">
            <h2>How to Take Care</h2>
            <p>Protect the luxury quality, texture and longevity of your Liu Jo garments with our specialist care guide.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="liujo-accordion">
            <details class="liujo-accordion__item" open>
              <summary class="liujo-accordion__title">
                <span>Fine Knitwear &amp; Cashmere</span>
                <span class="icon-toggle"></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="liujo-accordion__content">
                <p>Liu Jo knitwear is created using premium natural fibers like wool, mohair, and cashmere. To preserve their ultra-soft feel:</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>Hand wash in cold or lukewarm water (max 30°C) with a mild wool detergent.</li>
                  <li>Do not wring or rub vigorously; gently squeeze excess water between towels.</li>
                  <li>Always dry flat on a horizontal drying rack away from direct sunlight or radiators.</li>
                  <li>Fold knitwear inside drawers; never hang on clothes hangers to prevent shoulder stretching.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="liujo-accordion__item">
              <summary class="liujo-accordion__title">
                <span>Bottom Up Denim &amp; Jeans</span>
                <span class="icon-toggle"></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="liujo-accordion__content">
                <p>Our engineered Bottom Up denim maintains its sculpting elasticity and wash depth when properly treated:</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>Always turn jeans inside out before laundering to protect surface wash and metallic hardware.</li>
                  <li>Wash in cold water (max 30°C) on a delicate cycle without bleach or fabric softeners.</li>
                  <li>Air dry hung by the hem; avoid tumble drying as high heat degrades the elastane fibers.</li>
                  <li>Iron on the reverse side with medium steam.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="liujo-accordion__item">
              <summary class="liujo-accordion__title">
                <span>Leather, Suede &amp; Eco-Leather</span>
                <span class="icon-toggle"></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="liujo-accordion__content">
                <p>For Liu Jo jackets, footwear and handbags in genuine leather or eco-leather:</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>Clean smooth leather gently with a soft microfibre cloth slightly dampened with neutral water.</li>
                  <li>Use a specialised crepe brush for suede and nubuck to revive the nap.</li>
                  <li>Keep leather items away from direct heat sources and store bags stuffed with tissue paper in their protective dust bags.</li>
                  <li>For thorough cleaning, entrust only to a professional leather specialist cleaner.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="liujo-accordion__item">
              <summary class="liujo-accordion__title">
                <span>Silk &amp; Delicates</span>
                <span class="icon-toggle"></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="liujo-accordion__content">
                <p>Silk blouses and dresses require delicate handling:</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>Opt for specialist dry cleaning or delicate hand washing in cold water.</li>
                  <li>Never spray perfume or deodorant directly onto silk fabrics.</li>
                  <li>Iron while still slightly damp on the lowest silk setting, using a protective pressing cloth.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="liujo-accordion__item">
              <summary class="liujo-accordion__title">
                <span>Padded Coats &amp; Down Outerwear</span>
                <span class="icon-toggle"></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="liujo-accordion__content">
                <p>To retain the loft, warmth and volume of down coats:</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>Close all zippers and snap buttons before washing.</li>
                  <li>Wash at 30°C on a down/delicate program with gentle spin.</li>
                  <li>Tumble dry on low heat with clean tennis balls to evenly redistribute the down plumage.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB 7: FAQ -->
        <div class="liujo-cc-panel{% if section.settings.active_tab == 'faq' %} is-active{% endif %}" id="panel-faq">
          <div class="liujo-cc-panel__header">
            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
            <p>Find immediate answers to our most common customer inquiries.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="liujo-accordion">
            <details class="liujo-accordion__item" open>
              <summary class="liujo-accordion__title">
                <span>Is online shopping on Liu Jo secure?</span>
                <span class="icon-toggle"></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="liujo-accordion__content">
                <p>Every purchase on www.liujo.com is extremely secure because advanced technological encryption systems (SSL 256-bit) and VeriSign certificates are used. You will always be asked for CVV and 3D Secure confirmation to protect against unauthorized usage.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="liujo-accordion__item">
              <summary class="liujo-accordion__title">
                <span>How can I track my shipment?</span>
                <span class="icon-toggle"></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="liujo-accordion__content">
                <p>As soon as your parcel is dispatched from our warehouse, you will receive an email containing the direct carrier tracking link. You can also view shipping status inside your account under the “My Orders” section.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="liujo-accordion__item">
              <summary class="liujo-accordion__title">
                <span>How long does it take to receive a return refund?</span>
                <span class="icon-toggle"></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="liujo-accordion__content">
                <p>Refunds are initiated once the warehouse has inspected the returned goods (up to 7-10 business days after delivery). Depending on your banking institution, funds will appear on your card or PayPal within 3 to 5 business days.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="liujo-accordion__item">
              <summary class="liujo-accordion__title">
                <span>What is the Liu Jo Digital Gift Card?</span>
                <span class="icon-toggle"></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="liujo-accordion__content">
                <p>The Liu Jo Gift Card is an elegant digital voucher issued to bearer, usable both online and in participating boutiques. Available in denominations between €25 and €1,999, it is delivered instantly via email with a unique redemption code and no activation fees.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="liujo-accordion__item">
              <summary class="liujo-accordion__title">
                <span>How do I join The New Glam Lounge Loyalty Program?</span>
                <span class="icon-toggle"></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="liujo-accordion__content">
                <p>You can join The New Glam Lounge loyalty program online through your account profile or inside any Liu Jo boutique. Membership is complimentary and unlocks exclusive preview access to sales, anniversary gifts, and boutique styling sessions.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

